\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Context-length scaling ($L \in [128, 8192]$, $C{=}1$, 64 output tokens). \textbf  {(a)}~Mean TTFT shows FlashAttention-2 (\texttt  {\footnotesize  S2-C}--\texttt  {\footnotesize  S6-C}) matching or beating \texttt  {\footnotesize  stage-0-vllm} ($629.3$ vs.\ $673.7$~ms at $L{=}8192$), while \texttt  {\footnotesize  stage-2-vllm} cuts $L{=}8192$ TTFT $3.4\times $ to $198.3$~ms via prefix caching. \textbf  {(b)}~Mean TPOT exposes \texttt  {\footnotesize  S0-C}'s $O(S^2)$ blowup ($265.5$~ms at $L{=}2048$) vs.\ flat $7.50$--$8.60$~ms decoding in \texttt  {\footnotesize  S6-C}.}}{4}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:context}{{3}{4}{Context-length scaling ($L \in [128, 8192]$, $C{=}1$, 64 output tokens). \textbf {(a)}~Mean TTFT shows FlashAttention-2 (\stage {S2-C}--\stage {S6-C}) matching or beating \stage {stage-0-vllm} ($629.3$ vs.\ $673.7$~ms at $L{=}8192$), while \stage {stage-2-vllm} cuts $L{=}8192$ TTFT $3.4\times $ to $198.3$~ms via prefix caching. \textbf {(b)}~Mean TPOT exposes \stage {S0-C}'s $O(S^2)$ blowup ($265.5$~ms at $L{=}2048$) vs.\ flat $7.50$--$8.60$~ms decoding in \stage {S6-C}}{figure.caption.5}{}}
